          ],
          "content": "Q.5. Draw the letter ‘Y’ such that the three angles formed are $\\mathbf { 1 5 0 ^ { \\circ } ,   6 0 ^ { \\circ } }$ and $\\mathbf { 1 5 0 ^ { \\circ } } .$ Ans."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
